@baseUrl = http://localhost:5058
@bookId = 1

### 1. Obtener todos los libros (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obtener un libro por ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Crear un nuevo libro (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture: A Craftsman's Guide to Software Structure",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0134494166",
  "price": 34.99,
  "stock": 10
}

### 4. Actualizar un libro existente (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Clean Architecture (Edición Actualizada)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0134494166",
  "price": 39.99,
  "stock": 15
}

### 5. Eliminar un libro (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}} 